@ddd.repository

Purpose:
  Aggregate persistence abstraction.

UseWhen:
  - aggregate needs persistence
  - domain should not know about storage details
  - testability is required

AvoidWhen:
  - simple CRUD without domain logic
  - no persistence layer

Why:
  Decouples domain model from infrastructure concerns.

Related:
  @ddd.aggregate
  @patterns.repository

Examples:
  @project.payment
  @project.order

State: +
